1
00:00:00,320 --> 00:00:04,880
(Sheldon:)Alex, check my schedule.
What does my afternoon look like?

2
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:09,050
(Alex:)I think it's pretty wide open. Oh, wait.
Here's something at 4:00.

3
00:00:09,360 --> 00:00:11,680
"Give Alex a talking to"?

4
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:15,570
(Sheldon:)Well, that snuck up on us, didn't it?

5
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:20,370
- Is there a problem?
- Let's not call it a problem...

6
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:22,360
(Sheldon:)...let's call it an opportunity.

7
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:24,200
(Sheldon:)To solve a serious problem.

8
00:00:25,080 --> 00:00:26,290
(Alex:)What did I do?

9
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:28,720
(Sheldon:)You don't know? Oh, you poor dear.

10
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:31,880
(Sheldon:)Your ovaries are squirting so much
goofy juice into your brain...

11
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:34,090
...you don't know which way is up.

12
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:41,280
(Sheldon:)You made an inappropriate
sexual advance towards Dr. Hofstadter.

13
00:00:41,440 --> 00:00:45,130
(Alex:)What? I didn't make a sexual advance
on anybody.

14
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:47,450
(Sheldon:)Now, there's no need to get defensive.

